    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"What's up?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"It was about the work I mentioned earlier"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I wanted to explain what it actually is"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Yes finally, I was curious about it"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I'll be doing moderation for a website and live channel"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"The pay is pretty good"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"And everything can be done from my PC"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"That already sounds much better than having to leave the house"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"The only downside is the schedule"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"How so?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"There aren't really any fixed hours"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"When they need me, I have to be available immediately"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"And once a moderation session starts, I can't leave my PC until it's finished"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Not for food"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Barely for the bathroom"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"That does sound a little rough"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"But I understand it too"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"If they need urgent moderation, they probably need someone there immediately"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Will that be okay for you?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I think so"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"It's not perfect, but it's something I can actually do from home"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Then that's what matters"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"And now that I'm not working anymore, I'll have plenty of time"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"So don't worry about the rest"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I'll make sure you always have food, water and everything you need nearby"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"You can focus on your work without worrying about anything else"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"You're going to spoil me"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"After everything you've done for me lately?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I think it's only fair 😌"},
